OL,3,GNEWSAHealth warning issued as
OL,4,Atemperatures to plummet
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome people's health could be at risk
OL,7,Fas temperatures are set to plummet, the
OL,8,FUK Health Security Agency (UKHSA) has
OL,9,Fwarned.
OL,11,FIt has issued a yellow cold health
OL,12,Falert for the North West and West
OL,13,FMidlands from 09:00 BST on Thursday to
OL,14,Fmidday on Saturday.
OL,16,FIt warned that the cold could have a
OL,17,F"serious impact" on people with health
OL,18,Fproblems.
OL,20,FTemperatures could fall as low as -1C
OL,21,F(30F) in Chester, and Barnoldswick,
OL,22,FLancashire, on Friday morning.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
